{"4885600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Recursive Corridor", "steam_appid": 4885600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on the cold floor, not knowing how you got here. Endless corridors, a deep female voice echoing from afar, layer after layer—you can never escape her presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome back to the Dijiang, Administrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Administrator? Are you feeling a bit dizzy? It's all right. Come, lie down beside me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have waited for you for ten years. Now that you have finally returned to me, I will never let you leave again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never leave me..........</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never.........</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.....................</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prophet, I am waiting for you here.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885600/extras/59d0fc108c2819d1af1a73a27dd4a72f.avif?t=1783353907\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the anomaly-ridden Dijiang! Uncover the secret of Perica being possessed! Piece together the full story across different anomalies and escape this nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fan game based on <i>Arknights: Endfield</i>.<br>Except for the Perica model (official asset) and the shrub models (purchased from the Unity Asset Store), all other models were handmade, and no other unauthorized assets were used.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content Warning: Contains loud sounds. Not recommended for those with heart conditions.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up on the cold floor, not knowing how you got here. Endless corridors, a deep female voice echoing from afar, layer after layer—you can never escape her presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome back to the Dijiang, Administrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Administrator? Are you feeling a bit dizzy? It's all right. Come, lie down beside me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have waited for you for ten years. Now that you have finally returned to me, I will never let you leave again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never leave me..........</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never.........</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.....................</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prophet, I am waiting for you here.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885600/extras/59d0fc108c2819d1af1a73a27dd4a72f.avif?t=1783353907\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the anomaly-ridden Dijiang! Uncover the secret of Perica being possessed! Piece together the full story across different anomalies and escape this nightmare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a fan game based on <i>Arknights: Endfield</i>.<br>Except for the Perica model (official asset) and the shrub models (purchased from the Unity Asset Store), all other models were handmade, and no other unauthorized assets were used.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content Warning: Contains loud sounds. Not recommended for those with heart conditions.</p>", "short_description": "In the endless looping corridors, search for anomalies, uncover the truth behind Perica's possession, and escape this place.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885600/2454b1a8b4bd318d98401b7821fb51bed5c99d2e/header.jpg?t=1783353907", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4885600/740f6b90c9b38813cb0e6f7589bb2c7f65fcd32b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783353907",